tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">前OpenAI安全VP翁荔发布万字长文拆解Scaling Laws，指出模型数据配比存在偏差</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亚马逊宣布追加130亿美元投资，扩建印度AI与云基础设施</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布Codex增长报告：个人用户用量暴增137倍，非技术用户成主力</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果正式发布 Xcode 26.6，编程助手新增支持 Google Gemini 模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/03e92f930eecc528acc9066d4d97e1e0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司今日正式推送 Xcode 26.6 版本，核心亮点在于编程助手新增对 Google Gemini 的支持，开发者现可在 Anthropic Claude Agents 和 OpenAI Codex 之外，获得更多元的 AI 辅助编程选项。此次更新同步集成了 Swift 6.3.3 语言版本，并全面更新覆盖 iOS、iPadOS、tvOS、watchOS、visionOS 及 macOS 26.5 的全平台 SDK。除引入 Gemini 外，该版本还优化了 ACP 兼容能力并修复多项已知 Bug，旨在提升开发环境的稳定性与运行效率。此前苹果已在 Xcode 27 测试版中先行验证 Gemini 集成，此次下放至正式版标志着苹果正加速将主流大模型整合进开发生态。目前，开发者可直接从 App Store 免费</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">扩产受限需求高涨，AI存储紧缺周期或将延续至明年末</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3d95eb09ad758c32ba760bf4f26d7690.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">扩产受限需求高涨，AI存储紧缺周期或将延续至明年末AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 26, 202629美银证券高级半导体分析师Vivek Arya发布最新研判，人工智能正在推动内存行业出现结构性转型，AI专用存储芯片供需失衡状态至少将延续至 2027 年末。该分析师依托美光科技最新季度财报分析，AI优化型存储芯片生产所需产能，是传统计算存储产品的 3 至 4 倍。其提出“没有存储芯片，就没有人工智能”的行业论断，此轮存储厂商盈利大幅超预期，并非行业传统周期性回暖，而是AI算力需求带来的长期结构性增长。供应链层面，美光已与 16 家客户签订长期供货协议，锁定未来多年供货量、定价与交付保障，对冲供给波动风险。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">前OpenAI安全VP翁荔发布万字长文拆解Scaling Laws，指出模型数据配比存在偏差</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">前OpenAI安全研究副总裁翁荔在个人博客发布万字长文《Scaling Laws， Carefully》，深度拆解支撑大模型发展的Scaling Laws。文章指出，当前行业普遍遵循的Scaling Laws存在认知偏差，模型数据配比可能从一开始就走偏了。翁荔回顾了从Kaplan到Chinchilla的演变，指出Kaplan因实验规模限制及统计口径偏差，导致模型参数与数据增长比例的推论存在系统性错误。Chinchilla揭示的参数与数据1:20等比增长规律，已被后续Llama、DeepSeek等模型验证。此外，Epoch AI团队复现发现Chinchilla原始代码存在损失函数计算及幂律指数四舍五入等Bug。翁荔强调，Scaling Laws并非物理定律，而是对工程细节高度敏感的观测性指南。随着高质量文本数据预</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亚马逊宣布追加130亿美元投资，扩建印度AI与云基础设施</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cf68750812a802efaa251ec0cd0f913d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亚马逊首席执行官安迪·贾西于6月25日宣布，计划在2030年前向印度追加130亿美元投资，专项用于AI及云基础设施的建设与扩容。此次新增资金将重点扩展亚马逊云科技（AWS）在孟买和海得拉巴的数据中心容量，旨在提升当地算力水平并增强AI服务支持能力。加上此前规划，亚马逊在2026年至2030年期间于印度该领域的总投资额已超过210亿美元，使其成为印度市场规模最大的全球AI及云基础设施投资者之一。此举不仅反映了亚马逊对印度新兴市场的战略布局，也将加速当地算力基础设施的迭代，推动相关产业链的快速发展，进一步加剧海外头部厂商在AI基础设施领域的竞争。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布Codex增长报告：个人用户用量暴增137倍，非技术用户成主力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f58bf6d430c1f9a77228c4b71ce645c6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于6月25日发布报告，披露智能体AI产品Codex自2025年8月以来的用户增长数据：个人用户用量飙升137倍，组织用户增长189倍，OpenAI内部使用量增长12倍。目前，OpenAI内部员工Codex日常使用率已达97.9%，外部组织渗透率攀升至17.3%。数据显示，2026年上半年活跃用户增长超5倍，其中非技术用户群体增长最快，标志着AI编程工具已走出专业开发者圈子。Codex在长周期任务处理能力上表现突出，自2026年初以来，提交预估耗时超8小时任务请求的用户比例增长近十倍。这一趋势表明Codex正从辅助工具向能够独立执行任务的协作角色演变，AI编程赛道正经历由非程序员驱动的用户结构变革，加速向办公场景普惠化普及。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
